      "settings": {
        "title": "",
        "custom_HTML": "<style>\n  /* =========================================================\n     LEARN COLOR ANALYSIS\n     YOUR COLOR STYLE — 2026 DESIGN SYSTEM\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-page {\n    --bg-primary: #FAFAFA;\n    --bg-secondary: #FFFFFF;\n    --bg-soft: #F8F4F7;\n\n    --text-primary: #292832;\n    --text-secondary: #505868;\n    --headline-primary: #12253F;\n\n    --border-soft: #ECE8E3;\n    --border-violet: #DED5EA;\n\n    --violet: #7B5CFF;\n    --blue: #4DA1FF;\n\n    --gradient-primary: linear-gradient(90deg, #7B5CFF, #4DA1FF);\n    --shadow-soft: 0 18px 45px rgba(32, 28, 45, 0.08);\n    --shadow-hover: 0 22px 52px rgba(32, 28, 45, 0.13);\n\n    --radius-card: 28px;\n    --radius-small: 18px;\n    --container: 1220px;\n\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: var(--bg-primary);\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    font-family: inherit;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-container {\n    width: min(100% - 40px, var(--container));\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-section {\n    padding: 88px 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-section--white {\n    background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-section--soft {\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-eyebrow {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--violet);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page h1,\n  .ycs-learn-page h2,\n  .ycs-learn-page h3 {\n    margin-top: 0;\n    color: var(--headline-primary);\n    line-height: 1.08;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page h1 {\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n    font-size: clamp(42px, 5.2vw, 72px);\n    letter-spacing: -0.045em;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page h2 {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 50px);\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-page p {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-lead {\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin-bottom: 28px;\n    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 21px);\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-section-heading {\n    max-width: 780px;\n    margin: 0 auto 50px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-section-heading p {\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    max-width: 680px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  /* BUTTONS */\n\n  .ycs-learn-btn-row {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 14px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    min-height: 54px;\n    padding: 14px 26px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    transition:\n      transform 0.2s ease,\n      box-shadow 0.2s ease,\n      opacity 0.2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-btn:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-btn--primary {\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    background: var(--gradient-primary);\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(99, 95, 220, 0.22);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-btn--primary:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(99, 95, 220, 0.30);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-btn--secondary {\n    color: var(--headline-primary);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     HERO\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 95px 0 100px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(123,92,255,0.11), transparent 34%),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 35%, rgba(77,161,255,0.12), transparent 35%),\n      var(--bg-primary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(360px, 0.95fr);\n    gap: 65px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero-copy {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero-copy strong {\n    color: var(--headline-primary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-price-line {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 26px 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-price {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 850;\n    color: var(--headline-primary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-price-note {\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero-card {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 42px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(222,213,234,0.85);\n    border-radius: 34px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.91);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero-card::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 130px;\n    top: -30px;\n    right: -30px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      135deg,\n      rgba(123,92,255,0.17),\n      rgba(77,161,255,0.14)\n    );\n    z-index: -1;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-hero-card h3 {\n    font-size: 27px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-check-list {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-check-list li {\n    position: relative;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    padding-left: 31px;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-check-list li:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-check-list li::before {\n    content: \"✓\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--violet);\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     INTRO / WHY\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-two-col {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 70px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-copy p {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-highlight-card {\n    padding: 40px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-violet);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-card);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-highlight-card h3 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-highlight-card p:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     FRAMEWORK\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-framework {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-framework-card {\n    min-height: 255px;\n    padding: 34px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-card);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-framework-number {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--gradient-primary);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 850;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-framework-card p {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     WHO IT'S FOR\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 22px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-card {\n    padding: 35px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-card);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-card--yes {\n    border-color: var(--border-violet);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-title {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-icon {\n    display: flex;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #F2EEFF;\n    color: var(--violet);\n    font-weight: 900;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-card ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 21px;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-card li {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-audience-card li:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     MODULES\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-modules {\n    max-width: 940px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-module {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 88px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;\n    gap: 25px;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 28px 32px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 26px rgba(32, 28, 45, 0.045);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-module-number {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: var(--bg-soft);\n    color: var(--headline-primary);\n    font-size: 23px;\n    font-weight: 850;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-module h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 21px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-module p {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-access-badge {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    padding: 8px 13px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    background: #F2EEFF;\n    color: #6253C4;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     WHAT YOU'LL LEARN\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-feature-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-feature {\n    padding: 30px;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-feature h3 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-feature p {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     HOW IT WORKS\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-how-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 25px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-how-step {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-how-icon {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    width: 64px;\n    height: 64px;\n    margin: 0 auto 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--gradient-primary);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 850;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-how-step p {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     PRIMARY CTA\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta-wrap {\n    padding: 0 0 90px;\n    background: var(--bg-primary);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    max-width: 1040px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 60px;\n    border-radius: 34px;\n    background: var(--headline-primary);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 300px;\n    height: 300px;\n    top: -170px;\n    right: -80px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(123,92,255,0.23);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta h2 {\n    position: relative;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta p {\n    position: relative;\n    max-width: 660px;\n    margin: 0 auto 28px;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta .ycs-learn-btn-row {\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-cta-price {\n    position: relative;\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 850;\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     FREE GUIDE\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-free-card {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) auto;\n    gap: 35px;\n    align-items: center;\n    max-width: 940px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 38px 42px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-card);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-free-card h3 {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    font-size: 25px;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-free-card p {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     FAQ\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq {\n    max-width: 880px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq details {\n    padding: 23px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq details:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq summary {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-right: 38px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    color: var(--headline-primary);\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 4px;\n    top: -3px;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--violet);\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq details[open] summary::after {\n    content: \"−\";\n  }\n\n  .ycs-learn-faq details p {\n    max-width: 760px;\n    margin: 15px 0 0;\n    color: var(--text-secondary);\n  }\n\n  /* =========================================================\n     MOBILE\n     ========================================================= */\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .ycs-learn-hero-grid,\n    .ycs-learn-two-col {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-hero-grid {\n      gap: 45px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-framework,\n    .ycs-learn-feature-grid,\n    .ycs-learn-how-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-audience-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-module {\n      grid-template-columns: 70px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-access-badge {\n      grid-column: 2;\n      justify-self: start;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-free-card {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .ycs-learn-container {\n      width: min(100% - 28px, var(--container));\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-section {\n      padding: 65px 0;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-hero {\n      padding: 65px 0 70px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-hero-card {\n      padding: 30px 25px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-btn-row {\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-btn {\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-module {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 15px;\n      padding: 24px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-access-badge {\n      grid-column: auto;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-cta {\n      padding: 46px 25px;\n      border-radius: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .ycs-learn-free-card {\n      padding: 30px 25px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n\n<div class=\"ycs-learn-page\">\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       HERO\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-hero\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-hero-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-hero-copy\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Learn Color Analysis</span>\n\n          <h1>Learn to See Color Like a Color Analyst</h1>\n\n          <p class=\"ycs-learn-lead\">\n            Stop guessing at warm, cool, bright, muted, light and deep.\n            Learn the step-by-step Your Color Style approach to evaluating\n            personal coloring so you can understand <strong>why certain colors\n            work and others don't.</strong>\n          </p>\n\n          <p class=\"ycs-learn-lead\">\n            This self-paced course is designed for anyone who wants to\n            understand color analysis more deeply — without committing to\n            professional certification.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-price-line\">\n            <span class=\"ycs-learn-price\">$97</span>\n            <span class=\"ycs-learn-price-note\">one-time purchase</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-btn-row\">\n            <a href=\"#order\" class=\"ycs-learn-btn ycs-learn-btn--primary\">\n              Start Learning Color Analysis\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-hero-card\">\n          <h3>Inside the course you'll learn how to identify:</h3>\n\n          <ul class=\"ycs-learn-check-list\">\n            <li>The right depth of colors for a person</li>\n            <li>Warm, olive and cool undertones</li>\n            <li>Clear versus soft coloring</li>\n            <li>The details that make an analysis more personal</li>\n            <li>Which characteristic is most dominant</li>\n            <li>How to bring all the clues together into a final analysis</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       WHY LEARN COLOR ANALYSIS\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--white\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-two-col\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-copy\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Go Beyond The Color Quiz</span>\n\n          <h2>Color analysis is more than deciding if someone is warm or cool.</h2>\n\n          <p>\n            Personal coloring has multiple dimensions. Two people can both\n            have cool undertones and still need very different colors.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            One may look best in lighter, softer colors while another comes\n            alive in rich, clear shades.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            That's why Your Color Style teaches you to look at several\n            characteristics separately before bringing them together.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            Once you understand what you're looking for, color analysis\n            becomes much less mysterious.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-highlight-card\">\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">A Better Way To Learn</span>\n\n          <h3>Train your eye instead of memorizing types.</h3>\n\n          <p>\n            You won't simply be handed categories and asked to memorize\n            what belongs where.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            You'll learn the visual clues behind an analysis so you can\n            understand how and why a conclusion is reached.\n          </p>\n\n          <p>\n            That foundation makes it much easier to evaluate real people,\n            especially when their coloring doesn't fit neatly into a\n            traditional seasonal box.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       3 STEP FRAMEWORK\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-section-heading\">\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">The Foundation</span>\n        <h2>Start with three key characteristics</h2>\n        <p>\n          Instead of jumping immediately to a color type, you'll learn to\n          evaluate personal coloring one characteristic at a time.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework-card\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework-number\">1</div>\n          <h3>Depth</h3>\n          <p>\n            Is the person's overall coloring best supported by lighter,\n            medium or deeper colors? Learn how hair, skin and eyes contribute\n            to the depth a person can comfortably wear.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework-card\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework-number\">2</div>\n          <h3>Undertone</h3>\n          <p>\n            Learn to evaluate warm, olive and cool characteristics without\n            relying on overly simplified rules about veins, jewelry or a\n            single feature.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework-card\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-framework-number\">3</div>\n          <h3>Chroma</h3>\n          <p>\n            Does a person look best in clearer, more saturated colors or\n            softer colors? Learn how to recognize the difference and why\n            it matters.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       WHO IT'S FOR\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--white\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-section-heading\">\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Is This For You?</span>\n        <h2>Learn as much as you want — without becoming certified</h2>\n        <p>\n          This course sits between a simple introduction to color analysis\n          and professional analyst training.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-audience-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-audience-card ycs-learn-audience-card--yes\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-audience-title\">\n            <span class=\"ycs-learn-audience-icon\">✓</span>\n            <h3>This course is a great fit if...</h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <ul>\n            <li>You love color analysis and want to understand it at a deeper level.</li>\n            <li>You want to get better at recognizing undertones, depth and chroma.</li>\n            <li>You want to understand the Your Color Style methodology.</li>\n            <li>You enjoy studying photos and learning how coloring characteristics interact.</li>\n            <li>You're curious about professional color analysis but aren't ready to pursue certification.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-audience-card\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-audience-title\">\n            <span class=\"ycs-learn-audience-icon\">→</span>\n            <h3>If you want to work professionally...</h3>\n          </div>\n\n          <ul>\n            <li>This course does not provide Your Color Style certification.</li>\n            <li>It does not qualify you as a YCS Certified Color Consultant.</li>\n            <li>It does not include the full professional consultant training program.</li>\n            <li>If your goal is to build a professional color analysis business, certification is the appropriate next step.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       COURSE MODULES\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-section-heading\">\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Your Course</span>\n\n        <h2>Six modules that build your skills step by step</h2>\n\n        <p>\n          You'll begin with the fundamentals and progressively learn how\n          to combine the information into a more complete color analysis.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-modules\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-module\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-module-number\">01</div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3>Photo Prep + Understanding Depth</h3>\n            <p>\n              Learn what makes a photo useful for color analysis and begin\n              training your eye to recognize light, medium and deep coloring.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-access-badge\">\n            Immediate Access\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-module\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-module-number\">02</div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3>Understanding Undertones</h3>\n            <p>\n              Explore warm, olive and cool undertones and learn which clues\n              matter when evaluating a person's coloring.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-access-badge\">\n            Immediate Access\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-module\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-module-number\">03</div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3>Understanding Chroma</h3>\n            <p>\n              Learn the difference between clear and soft coloring and how\n              color intensity interacts with a person's natural features.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-access-badge\">\n            Immediate Access\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-module\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-module-number\">04</div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3>Specificity</h3>\n            <p>\n              Go beyond the three core characteristics and learn to notice\n              the additional details that make an analysis truly personal.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-access-badge\">\n             Immediate Access\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-module\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-module-number\">05</div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3>Dominance + Pulling It All Together</h3>\n            <p>\n              Learn which characteristic carries the most visual weight and\n              how depth, undertone, chroma and specificity work together.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-access-badge\">\n             Immediate Access\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-module\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-module-number\">06</div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h3>Wrap Up + Final Questions</h3>\n            <p>\n              Bring the process together, reinforce the key concepts and\n              clarify the most common questions that come up when learning\n              personal color analysis.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-access-badge\">\n             Immediate Access\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       WHAT YOU WILL LEARN\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--white\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-section-heading\">\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Build Your Eye</span>\n\n        <h2>You'll start noticing things you didn't see before</h2>\n\n        <p>\n          The goal isn't simply to know the definitions. It's to become\n          more confident recognizing them in real people.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature\">\n          <h3>Read the whole person</h3>\n          <p>\n            Learn why skin, hair and eyes need to be considered together\n            instead of relying on one feature.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature\">\n          <h3>Recognize depth</h3>\n          <p>\n            Develop a better sense of how light or deep a person's most\n            flattering colors should be.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature\">\n          <h3>See undertones</h3>\n          <p>\n            Become more skilled at recognizing warmth, coolness and the\n            nuanced characteristics of olive skin.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature\">\n          <h3>Understand chroma</h3>\n          <p>\n            Learn why some people shine in clearer colors while others need\n            slightly softer color intensity.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature\">\n          <h3>Notice individuality</h3>\n          <p>\n            See why two people with the same general color type can still\n            have noticeably different best colors.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-feature\">\n          <h3>Think like an analyst</h3>\n          <p>\n            Practice looking at evidence and combining visual clues rather\n            than trying to force someone into a predetermined box.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       HOW IT WORKS\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-section-heading\">\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">How It Works</span>\n\n        <h2>Learn on your own schedule</h2>\n\n        <p>\n          The lessons are delivered online so you can study from anywhere\n          and revisit the material as you build your eye.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-step\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-icon\">1</div>\n          <h3>Start Immediately</h3>\n          <p>\n            Get access to the all six modules as soon as you enroll.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-step\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-icon\">2</div>\n          <h3>Build Your Skills</h3>\n          <p>\n            Each lesson builds on\n            what you've already learned.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-step\">\n          <div class=\"ycs-learn-how-icon\">3</div>\n          <h3>Practice Seeing Color</h3>\n          <p>\n            Apply what you learn to photos and real people as your ability\n            to recognize color characteristics grows.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       MAIN CTA\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-cta-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-cta\">\n\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\" style=\"color:#BEB7FF;\">\n          Ready To Learn?\n        </span>\n\n        <h2>Start seeing color through the eyes of an analyst.</h2>\n\n        <p>\n          If you're fascinated by personal color analysis and want more than\n          surface-level rules, this course will give you a framework you can\n          actually understand and use.\n        </p>\n\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-cta-price\">$97</span>\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-learn-btn-row\">\n          <a href=\"#order\" class=\"ycs-learn-btn ycs-learn-btn--primary\">\n            Start Learning Color Analysis\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       FREE GUIDE SECONDARY CTA\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--white\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-free-card\">\n\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Not Ready For The Course?</span>\n\n          <h3>Start with the free Color Analysis Guide.</h3>\n\n          <p>\n            If you're just beginning to explore personal color analysis,\n            download the free guide first. You'll get an introduction to how\n            professional color analysis works and can decide if you'd like\n            to take your knowledge further.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <a href=\"/products/color-analysis-guide\" class=\"ycs-learn-btn ycs-learn-btn--secondary\">\n            Get The Free Guide\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- ======================================================\n       FAQ\n       ====================================================== -->\n\n  <section class=\"ycs-learn-section ycs-learn-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-learn-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-section-heading\">\n        <span class=\"ycs-learn-eyebrow\">Questions</span>\n        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-learn-faq\">\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Is this a color analyst certification course?</summary>\n          <p>\n            No. Learn Color Analysis is designed to teach you the methodology\n            and help you develop your understanding independently. It does\n            not certify you as a Your Color Style Color Consultant.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Do I need any experience with color analysis?</summary>\n          <p>\n            No. The course starts with the foundational concepts and builds\n            from there. It's appropriate for someone who is new to color\n            analysis as well as someone who already knows the basics and\n            wants a more structured understanding.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Do I get the entire course immediately?</summary>\n          <p>\n            You'll receive immediate access to the first three modules.\n            Module 4 unlocks after one week, Module 5 after two weeks and\n            Module 6 after three weeks. This gives you time to absorb each\n            concept before moving into the more advanced material.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Is Your Color Style a seasonal color system?</summary>\n          <p>\n            No. Your Color Style does not begin by placing someone into one\n            of four seasons. You'll learn to evaluate individual\n            characteristics such as depth, undertone and chroma first and\n            then bring those characteristics together.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Will this teach me how to analyze olive skin?</summary>\n          <p>\n            Olive undertones are included as part of learning undertones.\n            You'll learn why olive skin requires more nuance than simply\n            labeling someone warm or cool.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Can I use this course to decide if I want professional training?</summary>\n          <p>\n            Absolutely. It's a good way to learn the Your Color Style\n            methodology and discover how much you enjoy the analysis process\n            before deciding whether professional training is right for you.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>Is the course live?</summary>\n          <p>\n            No. Learn Color Analysis is an online course that you can work\n            through on your own schedule as each module becomes available.\n          </p>\n        </details>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>"
      }
    },
